        666.1005249023438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "conditioning on action sequences to generate state sequences. However, DyDiff’s primary focus is generating",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        668.0939331054688,
        540.2445678710938,
        678.0565185546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "synthetic on-policy data by modeling the interaction between a given single-step policy and the multi-step",
      "bbox": [
